  "solution": "Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> có một véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> có một véc-tơ chỉ phương <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên nó có một véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Cô-sin của góc giữa hai đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
